{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The continent of Iveria was created by the Goddess of Creation, Leah, as the setting for the diverse fantasy MMORPG 4Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three kingdoms have been entangled in a series of conflicts and disagreements over historical truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between the past and the future, you can become absorbed in the memories of others and travel through space and time via quests and instance dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your skills in exciting battles for castles and regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your side and charge into sweeping battles for critical strongholds alongside countless other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While uncovering more of the land\u2019s background story, 4Story invites you to plunge into adventures and create your own journey\u2014your Fourth Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fate of Iveria lies in your hands! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609170?t=1747014749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609170/8b918af87f0b1121c1fe648388d58bf16b5c489f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747014749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609170/1c00eaef641d75040e909d37b5119a38b2bb7620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747014749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609170/1c00eaef641d75040e909d37b5119a38b2bb7620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747014749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The continent of Iveria was created by the Goddess of Creation, Leah, as the setting for the diverse fantasy MMORPG 4Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three kingdoms have been entangled in a series of conflicts and disagreements over historical truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between the past and the future, you can become absorbed in the memories of others and travel through space and time via quests and instance dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your skills in exciting battles for castles and regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your side and charge into sweeping battles for critical strongholds alongside countless other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While uncovering more of the land\u2019s background story, 4Story invites you to plunge into adventures and create your own journey\u2014your Fourth Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fate of Iveria lies in your hands! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Zemi Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609170/5141dff550d6764d8f9dda0e7c5a56f5c2f30e57/header.jpg?t=1747014749","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127595,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127595/movie480.mp4?t=1747014747","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127595/movie_max.mp4?t=1747014747"},"name":"4STORY Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127595/87db22aacde0ac08ffcd95f1e265287939a3badc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747014747","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127595/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747014747","m